    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ama hina, PCniykita kawsarichisqata takyachiy
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstalling1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Just a moment, checking for updates. Your PC might restart a few times along the way. Please, don't turn it off until we're all done.
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstalling1:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Suyachaykuy, kunanyachiykunata maskachkan
  \oobeWelcome\LaunchNarratorInstruction:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qawana ñawinchaqwan dispositivoykita tupachinaykipaq, Willakuqta kawsarichiy Windows + Patachaq + Haykuy ñitinakuna ñitiy. Aswan haykurinalla imaynakasqankunapaq, Windows + U ñitinakunata ñity, utaq uran kuchupi Haykurinalla iconota akllay.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro5VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ok, enough intro. Let’s dig in.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro4VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: If you need an assistive screen reader, press the Windows, Control, and Enter keys at the same time to turn on Narrator.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Use your voice or the keyboard along the way, and if you’d like me to stay quiet, just select the little microphone icon towards the bottom of your screen.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: A little sign-in here, a touch of Wi-Fi there, and we’ll have your PC ready for all you plan to do.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Hi there! I’m Cortana, and I’m here to help.
  \oobeWelcome\CortanaAnimationAccString:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Cortana Parlay
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Harkasqa kunanyachiykunawan kay
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Allillan kunanchaykunata dispositivoyki llamp’u chaymanta harkasqa purichkan, yapa musuq imayna kanankuna munanki yanapaypaq aswan productivo dispositivokunapi apamuy. Kunanchay tupachiyninta akllay, chanta Uyakuy akllay kaykuna waqaychaypaq. Tupachiyninta wakin pachata tikray.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: %1 kuyuq ruwana %2 kaqta.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Uyakuy
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan yachay kay tupachiyninmanta
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader3:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Imayna tikraypaq kunanyachiy tupachiyninta Microsoft Store kaqpaq
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader2:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Imayna tikraypaq kunanyachiy tupachiyninta Windows Update kaqpaq
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader1:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kikillanmanta kunanyachiykunata Windows chaymanta Microsoft Store llamkanakunapaq
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: "Astawan willakuy" willaypaq hanaq tupachiyninpi akllay.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan willakuy
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody3:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kunanchay tupachiyniyki wakin pachata tikrayta atikunki sichus  Microsoft Store > Aswan rikuy > Tupachiyninta watukuchkan.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kunanchay tupachiyniyki wakin pachata tikrayta atikunki sichus Tupachiynin > Kunanchay chaymanta Harkasqa > Windows Update > Ñawpachasqa akllanakuna watakuchkan.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody1:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Allillan kunanchaykunata yanapay kay dispositivoyki harkaypaq chaymanta llamp'u chaymanta harkasqa qatiypaq. Sichus kikillanmanta kunanyachiykunata tariy akllanki, dispositivoykiman uraykachiyku utqhay hina hapirinalla kanku chanta  qhipa harkasqa allichaykuna chaymanta allichaykuna tiyankipuni, kayhina Microsoft Harkay, qawapayaq chaymanta firmware kunanchayta. Sichus mana kikillanmanta kunanyachiykunata tariyta akllankichu, Microsoft dispositivoyk hapirinalla kunanchaykunapaq chiqaqyachin. Sapa kuti willayku mayk'aq musuq kunanchaykuna hapirinalla. Chanta chikllayta atikunki sichus manachus kunanyachiykuna uraykachiyta, ichaqa mana hunta kunanyachiyta atikunkichu chaymanta harkasqanki uraykachinkikama chaymanta kaykuna churanki.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Allillan kunanchaykunata llamp’umanta dispositivoyki purichkan. Akllay sichus kikillanmanta Windows chaymanta Microsoft Store llamkana kunanchaykunawan tariyta munanki, chanta "Uyakuy." kaqta akllay
  \oobeUpdateSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiy
  \oobeSettings\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Sapallampaq tupachiynin dispositivoykipaq akllay
  \oobeSettings\SettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Microsoft sapallampaq patachaqta churan. Tupachiynin akllay, chanta <b>Uyakuy</b> akllay kaykuna waqaychaypaq. Kay tupachiynin sapa kutita tikrayta atikunki.
  \oobeSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: %1 kuyuq ruwana %2 kaqpi.
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiqnin
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiq, qawachiq llapa sapanchasqa tupachiyninpi qatiypaq
  \oobeSettings\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Riqsin wakin tinkunaypa pantaykunanta tiyachkayku - mana internet kaqman tinkisqa atikunkichu, utaq huk pantayta tukuyniykupi kanan. Hunta Microsoft Sapanchasqa Willakuyta maypipas kaqpaq tarikuykunaq k'utmunpi aka.ms/privacy kaqta qillqachkan maskaqmanta wakin dispositivopi ñawiriyta atikunki.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan yachay tupachiyninmanta
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kay <b>Aswan willakuy</b> kaqta akllay ñawpaq willay riqsinapaq, imayna Windows llamkanakunamanta, mana harkasqa web, willay astaymanta, hapiykunamanta harkaysikusqanta.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan willakuy
  \oobeSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tupachiynin Microsoft nisqakuna kanku. Kaykuna riy chaymanta qhaway, chaymanta "Uyakuy" mayk'aq kanki.
  \oobeSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiy
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Uyakuy
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Llapan sapanchasqa tupachiyninta uyakuy
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TelemetryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Next, choose whether or not you want to help Microsoft diagnose and fix issues.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TailoredVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: If you want tips, offers, and suggestions that are tailored to you, just select Accept.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Sapallampaq tupachiynin dispositivoykipaq akllay
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Uyakuy
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Riqsin wakin tinkunaypa pantaykunanta tiyachkayku - mana internet kaqman tinkisqa atikunkichu, utaq huk pantayta tukuyniykupi kanan. Hunta Microsoft Sapanchasqa Willakuyta maypipas kaqpaq tarikuykunaq k'utmunpi aka.ms/privacy kaqta qillqachkan maskaqmanta wakin dispositivopi ñawiriyta atikunki.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\MultiSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tupachiyniykita akllay, chaymanta <b>Uyakuy</b> kaqta waqaychanapaq. Kay <b>Aswan willakuy</b> tupanata tapukuy tupachiymanta willay tarinapaq, imayna tikranapaq, imayna Windows llamkanakunamanta, mana harkasqa webmanta, willay astaymanta, hapiykunamanta harkaysikusqanta.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LocationVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Now, choose if you want to let Microsoft and other apps use your location to help you with directions, weather, and more.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan yachay tupachiyninmanta
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan willakuy
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\InputDiagnosticsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: And if you want to help improve language recognition and suggestions for apps and services that run on Windows, you can choose to do that here.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\FindMyDeviceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: And if you ever lose your device, here's where you get to choose if you want help finding it.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiy
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\AdsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Last up for these settings, choose whether or not you want your ads to be more relevant to you.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Title:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Munasqa willay huñu
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Sapanchasqayki chaniyuqmi, chayrayku huñusqayku willaymanta yacharinaykita munaniku.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText2:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Digital waqllichiqmanta aswan harkay qukunanpaq Microsoft kallpanchakun. Chaypaqmi, Microsoft Defender SmartScreen chaymanta Smart App Control kaqpas watukusqayki webmanta, uraykachisqayki kipukunamanta, churasqayki ruwachisqayki llamkanakunamanta, mana harkasqa web winaykunamanta willaykunata huñunku. Kaykunam dispositivoyki, kichanayki mana harkasqa web, waqllichiq winaymanta harkaysisunaykipaq hapikun.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText1:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Microsoft dispositivoykimanta willayta huñukun, tupachiyninmanta, atiyninkunamanta, allin llamkasqanmanta ima. Munasqa qawapayay willayqa aswan pisi qawapayay willaymi dispositivoyki iñisqa, harkasqa, allin llamkaq kananpaq, chaymanta Windows kaqta allichanapaq.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader2:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Llamkanakunamanta, mana harkasqa webmanta harkay
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader1:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Munasqa qawapayay willay
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Willaykuna huñuy mañakusqa
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiq
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Aswan Willakuy
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcBodyText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Dispositivoyki kunanyachisqa, haskarsqa, allin llamkaq kananpaqmi Microsoft willakuyta huñun. Kayqa kanman kipuykikunamamanta, llamkanakuna tupachiymanta chaynallataq sasachakuy allichanamanta willakuykuna.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiq
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tinkunapi sasachakuykuna kachkan - internetman manam tinkisqa kachkawaq, utaq sasachakuy tukuchiyniykupi kachkan. Munasqa qawapayay willaymanta astawan yacharinaykipaq kay https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162067 kaqta qillqay tarikuykunapa kutmunpi ima maskanapi ima dispositivopipas.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Munasqa willay huñunamanta astawan yachariy
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Astawan yachariy
  \oobeSettingsAadc\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiy
