  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tinkiypi wakin sasachakuychusmi kachkan - ichapas internet mana tinkisqa kachkanki, utaq ñuqaykupapi sasachakuy kachkan. Microsoft Sapanchasqa Willakuyta haykapipas ñawinchawaq kayta qillqaspa aka.ms/privacy mayqin maskapipas tarikusqan siqipi mayqin dispositivopas.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Yupaypi harkaymanta aswan willakuy
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Dispositivoyki huk rawkanasqa yupi musyaq tiyan chayta Windows Hello kaqwan llamkan, sasa ñanwa kichanaykipaq quchkan chiqaqchaypaq riqsichiyniyki.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Camarayki Windows Hello kaqwan llamkan riqsichiypaq qamta, sasa ñanwa kichanaykipaq quchkan chiqaqchaypaq riqsichiyniyki.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows Hello rawkanasqa yupi icono
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows Hello uya icono
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceAnimationAltText:
