  \oobeHello\BioConsentTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Sichus uyaykiwan llamkay qallariy qatiyta munaspaykiqa utaq rukana riqsichiqniykiwan
  \oobeHello\BioConsentSubtitle:
