  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeAadcAgeConfirmationBodyText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: ¿Kay willakuy warmapaqchu, wayna sipaspaqchu?<br><br>Ayllupi aswan sullkakuna Microsoft yupaywan llamkay qallariptin, hayka watanman hinam sapanchasqa harkaniyuq kanqaku. Tayta mamakunapas Microsoft Warmakuna Harkaqpi huñuta tupachinkumanmi. Ayllu huñu paqarichiyqa tinkisqapi llapankuta harkasqata takyachin, chiqa kawsaypiñataq qawanapi hayka pacha kayta, winay suysuyta, maypi kasqan qunakuyta, hukkunatapas.
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qatiq
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tinkunapi sasachakuykuna kachkan - internetman manam tinkisqa kachkawaq, utaq sasachakuy tukuchiyniykupi kachkan. Microsoft yupaypi llamkay qallariymanta astawan yacharinaykipaq kay https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162068 kaqta qillqay tarikuykunapa kutmunpi ima maskanapi ima dispositivopipas.
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Huk Microsoft yupaywan llamkay qallariymanta astawan yachariy
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Astawan yachariy
