  \hololensAccount\LeadText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kikin yupaywan llamkayta qallriy chanta Office 365 kaqpaq utaq wak qatuna yanapakuykunapaq Microsoft kaqmanta ruwanki. Hatun llamkayniyki willakuy qammanta huñuyta atikun, llamkanakunata churay utaq qichuy, tupachiyninta tikray, imayna kanankunata wañuchiy, winasqata chinkachiy utaq dispositivoykita kawsarichiy.
  \hololensAccount\Error_UsernameFormat:
