  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpBody:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Mana munasqa kichanakuna, imayna llapa imayna yupaykunamanta ruwayta atikunki, PIN kaqniykiman kanan. PIN mana ruwasqa qaruman hackers kaqpaq kanan.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\ErrorDescription:
