  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Pisi simipi, qampa yanapayki atillchayki ima kani.<br/>Llamk’anapaq pacha kachkani.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Imaynalla, Cortana kani.<br/>imakuna hasa kananpaq imakunata ruwanapaq ima kaypi kachkani.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Cortana masiyki kan, wakin imakunawan yanapakuyta kanña chayta qamta súper, heroico, utaq pachallapi takyachin.<br/><br/>Cortana sapanchasqa yachaykuna chaymanta chaniyuq niykuna qun, Microsoft willakuy huñun chaymanta ruwan yapachkan tarikuyniykita chaymanta tarikuypa ñawpaq willakuynin, tupaqmasikuna, kunka yaykuna, rimay chaymanta makiwan qillqap pallakunan, qillqaspa ñawpaq willakuy, ñawpaq willakuy maskachkan, intiwatana kaqninkuna, willay chaymanta comunicacion ñawpaq willakuy willanakunamanta chaymanta llamkanakunamanta, chaymanta wak willakuy dispositivoykipi. Microsoft Edge kaqpi, Cortana maskana ñawpaq willakuyniyki huñun chaymanta ruwan. Pukllayta atikunkipuni imataq Cortana Yachaykunapaq blocpi yuyan chaymanta Cortana Microsoft Edge kaqpi wañuchin.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kichanaykita qillqay
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Harkypaq, huk aswan kuti kichanaykita qillqay.
